---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import CTA from '@/components/CTA.astro';
import Mark from '@/components/Mark.astro';
---
<Layout title="A thoughtful, practical approach to marketing" description="Meet the Mindlab approach: clear priorities, connected brand strategy, content and campaigns, and straightforward collaboration.">
  <section class="page-hero container about-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">The idea behind Mindlab</p><h1>Better questions.<br/>Clearer direction.</h1><p class="lede">Mindlab is being built around a simple belief: good marketing starts with understanding the business, then connecting the work.</p></div><div class="about-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><Mark/></div></section>
  <section class="section border-top"><div class="container editorial-grid"><h2>Thinking and doing<br/>belong together.</h2><div><p class="story-intro">A strategy should help you decide what to make. Content should carry the message. Campaigns should give that message a focused place to go.</p><p>Our three services bring those disciplines into one conversation. You can start with a focused project or choose ongoing support, based on what your business needs now.</p><p>We work from an agreed scope, use your expertise as a source, and make space for your feedback. The goal is useful work and clearer decisions at each step.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section tinted"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">What you can expect</p><h2>A practical working relationship.</h2><div class="values-grid">{[
    ['Clarity from the start', 'Deliverables, fees, revisions, and exclusions are visible before the work begins. Your written agreement confirms the detail.'],
    ['Your business in the room', 'We need your knowledge, access, and timely feedback. You know the business; we help turn that understanding into marketing work.'],
    ['Ownership that stays with you', 'Your advertising accounts and data belong to your business. Deliverable ownership follows the agreement.'],
    ['An honest review of the work', 'We discuss what happened and what to try next. We do not guarantee a number of leads, sales, or revenue.'],
  ].map(([title, body], index) => <article><span class="mono">0{index + 1} /</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{body}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
  <CTA title="Let’s start with your next decision."/>
</Layout>
